---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Documentation">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4 text-primary-900">Documentation</h1>
    <p class="text-primary-600 mb-12">Everything you need to integrate Gmail OAuth with inbox.dog.</p>

    <!-- Get Started -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary-400 font-medium mb-4">Get Started</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/connect" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">No code: Connect Gmail</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Create a key at inbox.dog/connect, link your Gmail in the browser. Then use MCP or the API with your key—no code.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/tutorial" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">With code: Tutorial</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Build a Gmail OAuth integration from scratch in 5 minutes.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Guides -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary-400 font-medium mb-4">Guides</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a href="/docs/guides/nextjs" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Next.js</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Add Gmail OAuth to a Next.js app with App Router.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/sveltekit" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">SvelteKit</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Add Gmail OAuth to a SvelteKit app.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/refresh" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Token Refresh</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Handle token expiry and refresh tokens correctly.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/mcp" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">MCP Server</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Give any AI agent Gmail access via the Model Context Protocol.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/openclaw" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">OpenClaw</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">MCP or Workspace Skill. Link to official OpenClaw setup.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/cursor" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Cursor</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">One-click install via Cursor's MCP deeplink. Link to Cursor docs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/claude" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Claude Desktop</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Add to claude_desktop_config.json. Link to Anthropic's MCP guide.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/windsurf" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Windsurf</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Add to mcp_config.json. Link to Windsurf MCP docs.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/guides/device-auth" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">CLI &amp; Agent Auth</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Authenticate Gmail from a terminal or AI agent — no callback server needed.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Reference -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary-400 font-medium mb-4">Reference</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/docs/api" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">API Reference</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Every endpoint, request shape, response shape, and parameter.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/errors" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Errors &amp; Troubleshooting</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Error codes, failure modes, and how to handle them.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Understand -->
    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-sm tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary-400 font-medium mb-4">Understand</h2>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="/docs/how-it-works" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">How inbox.dog Works</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Architecture, security model, and what happens under the hood.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/pricing" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Pricing</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Free for now. Self-host for free.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/self-host" class="group p-6 bg-white rounded-xl border border-primary-100 hover:border-primary-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-primary-900 mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-700">Self-Host</h3>
          <p class="text-primary-500 text-sm">Deploy to your Cloudflare account. CASA audit required for production Gmail write.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
